          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_trick_morph_single_canonical_3",
          "text": "The trick is to morph a single canonical 3D template and render its coordinates into a purely geometric 2D map, which then conditions a StyleGAN renderer for photorealistic synthesis.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
