          "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_dream_3_d_aware_image_generation",
          "text": "The dream in 3D-aware image generation is a model you can steer, one where you change the pose without touching identity, or swap the background without disturbing the object.",
