          "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_today_best_3_d_aware_gans",
          "text": "Today's best 3D-aware GANs make beautiful images, but their hybrid design fuses geometry and appearance together, so editing one factor bleeds into the others.",
