          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_stylemorph_instead_turns_morphable_i",
          "text": "StyleMorph instead turns the morphable model itself into something the network discovers from unlabeled 2D images, making it a first-class citizen of generative modelling.",
