    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "contribution",
      "heading": "Contribution",
      "chunks": [
        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c1_stylemorph_makes_three_linked_contri",
          "text": "StyleMorph makes three linked contributions. First, it learns a 3D morphable model of an object category's non-rigid shape variation using nothing but 2D images, by morphing a canonical template through backpropagation.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "stylemorph",
            "makes",
            "three",
            "linked",
            "contributions",
            "first",
            "learns",
            "3",
            "morphable",
            "object"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_second_introduces_template_object_co",
          "text": "Second, it introduces Template Object Coordinates, or TOCS: a deformable cousin of Normalized Object Coordinates that gives every surface point a stable template identity and acts as a powerful, deformation-equivariant descriptor of shape.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "second",
            "introduces",
            "template",
            "object",
            "coordinates",
            "tocs",
            "deformable",
            "cousin",
            "normalized",
            "object"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_third_feeds_2_tocs_maps",
          "text": "Third, it feeds 2D TOCS maps as a purely geometric conditioning signal into a StyleGAN-based deferred neural renderer, cleanly separating shape from appearance.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "third",
            "feeds",
            "2",
            "tocs",
            "maps",
            "purely",
            "geometric",
            "conditioning",
            "signal",
            "stylegan-based"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_together_these_deliver_disentangled",
          "text": "Together these deliver disentangled control over pose, shape, object appearance, and background, all at high resolution.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "together",
